{"id":8867095806151,"title":"Cow with Landscape Patchwork Quilt, Animal Farmhouse Printed Quilt Set","handle":"cow-with-landscape-patchwork-quilt-animal-farmhouse-printed-quilt-set","description":"\u003cp\u003eEmbrace the rustic charm of the countryside with our Jeminise Farmhouse Quilt Set. Featuring classic patterns and soft fabrics, this quilt set adds a cozy, timeless touch to any bedroom, making it a perfect gift for loved ones.\u003c\/p\u003e\u003ch3\u003eKey Features\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eRustic Farmhouse Design:\u003c\/strong\u003e Enjoy the classic patterns and soft, natural aesthetics that bring a cozy, timeless look to your bedroom.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eCustomization Options:\u003c\/strong\u003e Personalize your quilt set by selecting from various sizes, adding optional pillowcases, or including a name for a unique touch.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eAvailable in Multiple Sizes:\u003c\/strong\u003e Choose from Throw (60''x70''), Twin (68''x86''), Full (80''x90''), Queen (90''x90''), or King (102''x91'') to perfectly fit your bed.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eThoughtful Gift Idea:\u003c\/strong\u003e An excellent gift for Christmas, New Year, holidays, anniversaries, or birthdays for mom, dad, sister, brother, grandma, grandpa, wife, husband, son, daughter, and other beloved ones.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eEasy Care:\u003c\/strong\u003e This microfiber quilt set is machine washable in cold water and can be air dried without heat for simple maintenance and lasting fluffiness.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eIncluded Components:\u003c\/strong\u003e Each set includes one quilt, with the option to add two pillowcases for a complete look.\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\u003ch3\u003eProduct Specifications\u003c\/h3\u003e\u003ctable\u003e\u003ctbody\u003e\n\u003ctr\u003e\n\u003cth\u003eBrand\u003c\/th\